WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.519
Speaker 1: So yesterday, I covered the blow
up during a Senate hearing between Republican

00:00:03.519 --> 00:00:07.200
Senator Rand Paul and Dr. Anthony Fauci of
the NIH.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:13.190
And during that hearing, Dr. Fauci told Senator
Rand Paul in no uncertain terms that Rand

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:17.101
Paul, quote, doesn't know what he's talking
about and that if anyone is lying there, it's

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:19.050
Rand Paul himself.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.500
This apparently has so infuriated Rand Paul.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.500
He's on tilt.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.700
He's unhinged that Rand Paul now says he is
requesting a criminal referral against Dr.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.360
Fauci for allegedly lying to Congress.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:37.340
The intimidation that is being carried out
against scientists and against medical professionals

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.250
is completely appalling.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:44.720
Take a look at this from a recent Rand Paul
appearance on Fox News, where he announced

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:48.410
this, which he seems to be announcing almost
like it's some kind of badge of honor that

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:51.480
he's willing to take this incredibly principled
step.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:57.300
Speaker 2: You kicked off your questioning
of Dr. Fauci emphasizing federal law makes

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.820
lying to Congress a felony punishable by up
to five years in prison.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:07.229
Is your belief based on the evidence, Senator,
that he lied before Congress and broke the

00:01:07.229 --> 00:01:08.229
law?

00:01:08.229 --> 00:01:09.229
Yes.

00:01:09.229 --> 00:01:13.170
And I will be sending a letter to the Department
of Justice asking for a criminal referral

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.610
because he has lied to Congress.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:21.510
Speaker 1: This is an absolutely ghastly and
dreadful direction for the country to go in,

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:23.740
and it's a very, very dangerous one.

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:32.490
Dr. Peter Hotez posted to his Twitter a link
to an essay from 1940 one by Wildomar Kemfert

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:35.930
called Science in the Totalitarian State.

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:42.551
And it reminds us that the targeting of scientists
and doctors has a really ugly history, in

00:01:42.551 --> 00:01:45.150
particular in the 20th century.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:49.750
Remember that Albert Einstein decided to go
to the US at the very end of nineteen thirty

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:53.840
two, eventually came to the United States
in nineteen thirty three and stayed because

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:59.840
of what was happening in Europe, including
with reference to the world of science and

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:03.460
attacks on science are simply a totalitarian
hallmark.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.170
Now, I'm not saying Rand Paul is Hitler.

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.270
I'm not saying Rand Paul is Hitler.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.890
I'm not saying Rand Paul is Hitler.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.800
You have to clarify these things.

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.959
Otherwise, I will be very much punished for
the next twenty four hours on Twitter.

00:02:15.959 --> 00:02:22.340
This means that when we see scientists and
doctors under attack for doing their jobs,

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.900
it should really scare us.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:28.330
Now, fortunately, the current Department of
Justice is unlikely to actually do anything

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:31.540
with this request from Rand Paul under Merrick
Garland.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:36.390
But what would a William Barr Department of
Justice under Donald Trump have done or someone

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.980
like Trump have done in such a case?

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:44.860
It's still a stretch, but it's within the
realm of maybe they'd look at whether Dr.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:47.240
Fauci should be charged with something.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:51.070
And this is a really, really chilling proposition.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:56.470
So in terms of the confrontation between Dr.
Fauci and Rand Paul that we looked at yesterday,

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:59.030
I'm glad that Dr. Fauci took off the kid gloves.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:02.870
I'm glad Dr. Fauci called Rand Paul out Foushee.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.451
He almost looked uncomfortable doing it.

00:03:04.451 --> 00:03:10.280
It's not really his thing, but how else is
he supposed to deal with the just persistent

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:17.989
attacks on science and scientists, attacks
on his morality, attacks on his ethics, and

00:03:17.989 --> 00:03:22.670
unfortunately, much the way that Trump had
this longer term effect on the coarsening

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:28.780
of political discourse that went beyond Trump's
presidency, the legitimization of attacks

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:33.209
on just basic science, you know, masks and
vaccines, for example.

00:03:33.209 --> 00:03:40.700
It I fear, and it seems pretty clear that
that is going to be seen as a legitimate way

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:45.080
to attack science that the right doesn't like
for a long time.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:50.320
This is it's very clear that this is now a
tool of the American right wing and they can

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:51.320
use it.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:53.300
They can use as a cudgel.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:55.549
Science is just opinion.

00:03:55.549 --> 00:03:57.170
Scientists are just politicians.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:03.120
You can ignore empirical statements that come
from the scientific method, just like you

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:07.120
can ignore one of your political opponents
opinion about abortion.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.120
Right.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:09.120
They are making these things equivalent.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:12.000
It's not as I've said before, don't don't
hurt me.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.000
I know this.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.190
I say this often.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:18.769
It's not about we disagree as to what the
facts are.

00:04:18.769 --> 00:04:25.449
It's they don't understand what are facts,
what types of statements are facts and what

00:04:25.449 --> 00:04:27.349
types of statements are opinions.

00:04:27.349 --> 00:04:32.740
And it's not new in that, for example, with
climate change, they've been denials for a

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.849
long time for sure.

00:04:34.849 --> 00:04:40.520
But the mask and the vaccine stuff and even
denying the basics of how coronavirus works

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:41.629
for a very long time.

00:04:41.629 --> 00:04:48.270
And even now to some degree, that's more than
we can't yet say with certainty whether we

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:52.330
are damaging the planet long term like I think
we are.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:55.180
But that's a different type of denialism.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:05:02.229
That's denialism, but it's different than
the virus is fake or masks do nothing or the

00:05:02.229 --> 00:05:04.469
vaccine harms you.

00:05:04.469 --> 00:05:09.879
Or this was created as a bioweapon in a lab
and deliberately released the legitimization

00:05:09.879 --> 00:05:14.770
of that degree of nonsense as being just as
valid as the science.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:18.199
It's actually almost post-modern in a sense.

00:05:18.199 --> 00:05:23.149
Think about that, because for postmodernism
has been a popular target of the right.

00:05:23.149 --> 00:05:28.279
Now, I've criticized postmodernism as well,
but the way the right does it the right comes

00:05:28.279 --> 00:05:33.380
out and says postmodernism is the Marxist
enemy.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:40.419
Postmodernism leads you into any any notion
from whoever about anything is valuable to

00:05:40.419 --> 00:05:42.020
all this different stuff.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.779
They are essentially doing a form of that.

00:05:44.779 --> 00:05:50.650
They are saying our opinion about what coronaviruses
should be held up is just as valid as what

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.369
doctors think.

00:05:52.369 --> 00:05:58.339
Our harebrained conspiracy theories about
vaccination should be considered just as valid

00:05:58.339 --> 00:06:02.499
and serious and legitimate as what medical
science says.

00:06:02.499 --> 00:06:07.220
It's a form of postmodernism and post structuralism
in which they are engaged.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:13.050
It's a total hypocrisy that shouldn't surprise
us, but it's also very, very dangerous.

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:19.979
And we should be glad that the Merrick Garland
Department of Justice, I can imagine, is going

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:26.659
to take even remotely seriously Rand Paul's
request for a criminal referral against Dr.

00:06:26.659 --> 00:07:35.249
Anthony Fauci.

